.\" Man page for rocotometrics
.TH ROCOTOMETRICS 1 "July 2025" "Rocoto" "Rocoto User Commands"

.SH NAME
rocotometrics \- Display runtime metrics for Rocoto daemon processes

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rocotometrics
[\fIOPTION\fR]...

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rocotometrics
is a utility for monitoring and reporting on Rocoto daemon processes running on the system. It provides information about daemon instances, resource usage, thread counts, and system statistics.

The utility monitors three types of Rocoto daemons:
.IP \(bu 2
.B rocotobqserver
\- Batch queue server daemon for performance optimization
.IP \(bu 2 
.B rocotodbserver
\- Database server daemon for workflow state management
.IP \(bu 2
.B rocotoioserver
\- I/O server daemon for file system operations

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message and exit

.TP
.B \-v, \-\-verbose \fR[\fILEVEL\fR]
Run in verbose mode. Optional level (default: 1)

.TP
.B \-d, \-\-database \fIPATH\fR
Path to database store file (optional, for future integration)

.TP
.B \-w, \-\-workflow \fIPATH\fR  
Path to workflow document (optional, for future integration)

.TP
.B \-u, \-\-user\-stats
Show per-user daemon statistics including process counts, thread counts, and memory usage by user

.TP
.B \-s, \-\-system\-stats
Show system-wide daemon statistics including system load, memory usage, and daemon distribution

.TP
.B \-t, \-\-threads
Show thread information for all daemon processes including thread counts and lightweight process (LWP) information

.TP
.B \-p, \-\-processes
Show detailed process information including PID, PPID, resource usage, CPU/memory percentages, and elapsed time

.SH OUTPUT FORMATS

.SS Default Summary
When run without specific options, displays a summary showing:
.IP \(bu 2
Process counts by daemon type
.IP \(bu 2
Total thread counts
.IP \(bu 2
Memory usage in MB
.IP \(bu 2
List of active users

.SS User Statistics (\-u)
Per-user breakdown showing:
.IP \(bu 2
Total processes and threads per user
.IP \(bu 2
Memory usage per user
.IP \(bu 2
Daemon type distribution per user

.SS System Statistics (\-s)  
System-wide information including:
.IP \(bu 2
Current system load averages
.IP \(bu 2
Total and available system memory
.IP \(bu 2
Average CPU and memory percentages by daemon type

.SS Thread Information (\-t)
Detailed thread information showing:
.IP \(bu 2
Process ID and owner
.IP \(bu 2
Thread and LWP counts
.IP \(bu 2
Resident Set Size (RSS) memory usage
.IP \(bu 2
Process elapsed time

.SS Process Information (\-p)
Complete process details including:
.IP \(bu 2
Process and parent process IDs
.IP \(bu 2
User ownership
.IP \(bu 2
Thread counts and memory usage (RSS and VSZ)
.IP \(bu 2
CPU and memory percentages
.IP \(bu 2
Process elapsed time

.SH EXAMPLES

.TP
.B rocotometrics
Show basic summary of all Rocoto daemons

.TP  
.B rocotometrics \-u
Show per-user daemon statistics

.TP
.B rocotometrics \-s \-t
Show system statistics and thread information

.TP
.B rocotometrics \-p \-v 2
Show detailed process information with verbose logging

.SH FILES
.TP
.I /proc/loadavg
System load average information

.TP
.I /proc/meminfo
System memory information

.TP
.I /proc/*/status
Process status information

